From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] VU1 interpreter: speed, EFU opcodes, register jumps and a
 shared upper engine

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0024: VU1 interpreter speed-up
- 0026: VU1 EFU opcode decode
- 0027: VU1 register jumps read the current VI
- 0029: VU1 upper engine and constexpr decode
